  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed variation of Condition 11 (Cycle Parking) of planning permission P/2017/0598 would result in the existing mixed use building providing inadequate cycle parking capacity for its nine flats and ground floor restricted retail, showroom and office unit, reduce the usability and inclusivity of its retained cycle parking facilities, would lead to an unsatisfactory development of the site and fail to promote sustainable forms of transport and be contrary to London Plan policies T4 and T5 and Local Plan policy EC2.  ",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed variation of Condition 14 (Car Parking) of planning permission P/2017/0598 would result in a car parking bay with poor driver visibility and inadequate vehicle manoeuvrability while reducing the existing building's capacity and quality of cycle parking facilities contrary to the approved details of Condition 11 of planning permission P/2017/0598, harming the vehicular, pedestrian and cyclist safety of the existing building's basement floor car park, its access ramp and the adjoining public highway contrary to London Plan policy T6 and Local Plan policy EC2.  "
